#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_mixed_model.rst:10
msgid "模型简介"
msgstr "Model introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_mixed_model.rst:12
msgid ""
"混合模型结合了多种计算机视觉任务，可以在一次推理中同时执行多个任务，如同时进行目标检测、分类和关键点检测等。这种模型适用于需要多维度信息的复杂应用场景，既能提高效率，又能保证不同任务之间的信息一致性。"
msgstr ""
"Hybrid models combine multiple computer vision tasks and can perform "
"multiple tasks simultaneously in one inference, such as simultaneous object "
"detection, classification, and key point detection.This model is suitable "
"for complex application scenarios that require multi-dimensional "
"information, which can not only improve efficiency but also ensure "
"information consistency between different tasks."

