"**Q: What are the advantages of hybrid models over running multiple single "
"models separately?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_mixed_model.rst:229
msgid "A:"
msgstr "A:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_mixed_model.rst:230
msgid "**性能优势**：共享特征提取，计算量大幅减少，速度更快"
msgstr ""
"**Performance Advantages**: Shared feature extraction, greatly reduced "
"calculations and faster speed"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_mixed_model.rst:231
msgid "**一致性**：所有任务基于相同的特征，结果更一致"
msgstr ""
"**Consistency**: All tasks are based on the same features, and the results "
"are more consistent"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_mixed_model.rst:232
msgid "**准确性**：任务之间可以相互增强，提高整体准确度"
