"**Convenience**: Obtain all results in one inference, simplifying workflow"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_mixed_model.rst:235
msgid "**Q: 如何理解混合模型的置信度？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to understand the confidence of a mixed model?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_mixed_model.rst:237
msgid "A: 混合模型通常为每个任务输出独立的置信度："
