msgstr "Object attribute annotation (if required)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_mixed_model.rst:251
msgid "**Q: 所有任务都必须成功才输出结果吗？**"
msgstr "**Q: Do all tasks have to be successful before results are output?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_mixed_model.rst:253
msgid "A: 不是。每个任务独立输出结果。某个任务失败（置信度过低）不影响其他任务的输出。"
msgstr ""
"A: No.Each task outputs results independently.Failure of a task (confidence "
"is too low) does not affect the output of other tasks."

